# Provenance: composed from the two real halves captured on 2026-09-11 and
# 2026-09-15 - `2020.3.49f1-personal-editor-route-granted.log` (activation) and
# `personal-return-success.log` (return) - into the single stream a one-container
# `game-ci test` produces. Line contents are verbatim from those two runs.
#
# This is the shape the capability matrix now grades: activate, do the work,
# return, all in one container, so the return is both possible (same machine
# identity) and measurable. It is also the only shape a user can actually run,
# and until this change the repository had never measured it end to end.
